sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User (Next.js Dashboard)
    participant C as SystemDesignController
    participant S as SystemDesignService
    participant R as RuleEngineService
    participant G as RAG Engine (Python)
    participant L as Ollama Chat Service
    participant DB as SQL Server (EF Core)

    U->>C: Submit Problem Statement
    C->>S: Request Design Session
    
    par Deterministic Logic
        S->>R: Apply Architecture Rules (RuleEngine)
        R-->>S: Return Guardrail Constraints
    and Knowledge Retrieval
        alt RAG Enabled
            S->>G: Query Knowledge Base (ChromaDB)
            G-->>S: Return Document Context
        end
    end

    S->>L: Generate Final Design (LLM + Context)
    L-->>S: Returns JSON Design
    S->>DB: Save DesignSession & ReasoningRecords
    S-->>C: Return Recommendation Result
    C-->>U: Display Visualization
